# Day 3 – Logical Operators

## Topic
Behavioral Modeling

## Description
Implemented Logical Operators in Verilog using Behavioral Modeling and verified the functionality through simulation using a custom testbench in QuestaSim.

## Logical Operators Covered
- Logical AND (&&)
- Logical OR (||)
- Logical NOT (!)

## Key Learning
Understood how logical operators evaluate expressions as TRUE or FALSE and how they behave when operands contain unknown (`X`) values.

